sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Owner as Utilizador (dono)
  participant FE as Frontend (Next.js)
  participant APIG as API Gateway
  participant PRJ as Projects Service
  participant DB as MongoDB (projects)

  Owner->>FE: "Share" (perm=view/edit)
  FE->>APIG: POST /projects/:uid/:pid/share\n{permission, unsaved}
  APIG->>PRJ: POST /:uid/:pid/share (auth)
  alt unsaved == true
    PRJ-->>APIG: 409 Save your project before sharing
    APIG-->>FE: erro
  else ok
    PRJ->>DB: create ShareLink(token=32B->64hex)
    DB-->>PRJ: {token, permission, created_at}
    PRJ-->>APIG: 201 {token, permission}
    APIG-->>FE: 201 {token, permission}
    FE-->>Owner: mostra URL /share/:token
  end

  Note over Owner,FE: Dono partilha o link (fora do sistema)

  actor Guest as Destinatário
  participant FE2 as Frontend (guest)
  Guest->>FE2: abre /share/:token
  FE2->>APIG: GET /projects/share/:token
  APIG->>PRJ: GET /share/:token
  PRJ->>DB: ShareLink.findOne(token)
  alt token inválido ou revoked
    PRJ-->>APIG: 404 Invalid or revoked link
    APIG-->>FE2: erro (mensagem clara)
  else token válido
    PRJ->>DB: Project.getOne(owner_id, project_id)
    PRJ->>DB: ShareLink.touchAccess(token)
    PRJ-->>APIG: 200 {project, permission}
    APIG-->>FE2: dados do projeto
  end
